            0.461,
            0.33,
            0.761,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fig. 9.7: Formation of a chlorine molecule"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.321,
            0.355,
            0.888,
            0.406
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since, the two atoms that share one electron pair are said to be bonded by a single covalent bond, the chlorine (Cl ) molecule can be represented as Cl— Cl."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.352,
            0.408,
            0.804,
            0.427
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us explore the bonding in an oxygen molecule."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.321,
            0.429,
            0.89,
            0.498
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Write down the electronic configuration of the oxygen atom (atomic number 8). You can observe that the number of electrons present in its valence shell is six, and it requires two more electrons to complete its octet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.322,
            0.5,
            0.888,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, two oxygen atoms share two electrons each, forming an oxygen molecule (O ), as shown in Fig. 9.8."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
